{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/3c5c69a167a352463cbb7a00c3123bc6.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Handy,&quot; the feline phantom thief, has stolen a clock hand from the Time Museum.\u200b</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Wield its mysterious power to freeze time, slip through merciless curtains of bullets, </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>outsmart patrolling guards, and claw your way out of the Time Museum!\u200b</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/11797cf6846b370bee6da12ee4919885.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1a7104db7bed94b5deb5ed62d7dab71d.poster.avif?t=1764226564\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1a7104db7bed94b5deb5ed62d7dab71d.webm?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1a7104db7bed94b5deb5ed62d7dab71d.mp4?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At do-or-die moments, stop time to dodge patterns, line up the perfect strike, and take control of the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master the rhythm between frozen instants and live danger to turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/66f94a76ad19b1b6f29930b46bf78c63.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1efc15a8d35e6b6a5fb01a03b058fa30.poster.avif?t=1764226564\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1efc15a8d35e6b6a5fb01a03b058fa30.webm?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/1efc15a8d35e6b6a5fb01a03b058fa30.mp4?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every action spends &quot;time.&quot; When the clock hits zero, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">the clock hand's power rewinds the run to the moment Handy first touched it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Manage your time across Time Stop, HP, and shopping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Defeat enemies and gather &quot;Timeshards&quot; to extend your escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/0cff795f8b27ed7d5d92dfab4c19b1b9.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/7e39ff8e867ccd5ecd01c939a9609bb3.poster.avif?t=1764226564\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/7e39ff8e867ccd5ecd01c939a9609bb3.webm?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/7e39ff8e867ccd5ecd01c939a9609bb3.mp4?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The museum is packed with exhibits beyond the clock hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Borrow and combine items to create powerful synergies and grow stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/bd5bd8c48f7957fabe2e12dea3e40409.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/b0dcb0dd60e2c584093b9effb5d80b2d.poster.avif?t=1764226564\" width=680 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/b0dcb0dd60e2c584093b9effb5d80b2d.webm?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/b0dcb0dd60e2c584093b9effb5d80b2d.mp4?t=1764226564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The closer Handy gets to freedom, the tougher the enemies and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each area introduces unique level mechanics and attack patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use Time Stop and your borrowed loadout to overcome every roadblock!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191110/extras/2b24f81c5c61eb6722c8611324db4aaf.avif?t=1764226564\" width=960 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Costumes don't just make Handy look cool. They also remix gameplay with distinct twists!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find the style that fits you and crack the museum's defenses in your own way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Time Snatcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/53f07d93a5bac2c7425ef8666884baedf401ebc1.jpg"},{"name":"Archive of Almost Everything","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/5e8c90dfc4ce0c49f7dbb16e5bbdeb7e6cc67013.jpg"},{"name":"Time Museum - Main Hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/5838de450d81f045a425e4c75961aa9d1316025e.jpg"},{"name":"Sea of Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/840a5561c70a4a68a16b55e653aecef94ea49d8b.jpg"},{"name":"Catch the Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/a0981c9aef003b0d08041fb831f113d090e41aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Bored Cuckoo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/9d98d887ef39d7cee09f1507796a0c0175128bc1.jpg"},{"name":"Within Ouroboros","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3191110/fc1f1006302b2914db2b943657e61b5d6d1f947f.jpg"},{"name":"Prison Break","path